ES INTERNATIONAL, INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , JUNE 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. ("CHARLES RIVER" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: CRL). CLASS PERIOD: MAY 5, 2020 – FEBRUARY 21, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: JULY 18, 2023 IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF OF THE CHARLES RIVER LAWSUIT, YOU CAN SUBMIT YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AT WWW.GLANCYLAW.COM/CASES/CHARLES-RIVER-LABORATORIES-INTERNATIONAL-INC/.'}{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-06-23 05:45:00', 'title': 'CRL SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS CHARLES RIVER SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JULY 18, 2023', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NYSE: CRL). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/CHARLES-RIVER-CLASS-ACTION-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=41198&FROM=4 THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES FOR SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED CHARLES RIVER BETWEEN MAY 5, 2020 AND\xa0FEBRUARY 21, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2023-06-23 08:30:00', 'title': "CHUBB APPOINTS MICHAEL O'DONNELL CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER OF GLOBAL REINSURANCE", 'text': "ZURICH , JUNE 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHUBB LIMITED (NYSE: CB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MICHAEL O'DONNELL HAS BEEN APPOINTED CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, GLOBAL REINSURANCE. CURRENTLY, HE SERVES AS DIVISION PRESIDENT OF CHUBB TEMPEST RE USA."}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2023-06-23 14:41:00', 'title': 'CADUCEUS APPOINTS DAVID JI AS NEW CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER', 'text': 'CHINO, CALIF., JUNE 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CADUCEUS SOFTWARE SYSTEMS, CORP. (OTC PINK: CSOC) ("CADUCEUS" OR THE "COMPANY"), PARENT COMPANY OF MCLOVIN\'S PET, A DISTRIBUTOR